### PASSO 1: Criar os 3 depósitos do cliente (750 dias atrás, 200 dias atrás e 12 dias atrás)
# Clique no Play aqui primeiro! Ele já salva os 3 lotes no banco e consulta o BACEN!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cdb/popular-simulacao
Accept: application/json

### GET request to example server
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/cdb/carteira

###

### GET request to example server
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/cdb/simular?valor=2000.00

###
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/cdb/simular?valor=15000.00
Accept: application/json

### 1. Criar conta no Microserviço NestJS (Porta 3001)
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Mateus",
  "email": "mateus@banco.com",
  "senha": "1234567891"
}

### 2. Fazer Login no NestJS e receber o Token JWT + clientId!
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mateus@banco.com",
  "senha": "1234567891"
}